msgid ""
"We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill "
"the purpose for which it was collected, provide support, maintain relevant "
"records, or comply with applicable legal obligations. When the information is no "
"longer required, we take appropriate steps to delete it, subject to applicable "
"retention requirements."
